    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play fast card duels, open booster packs, discover cards with powerful synergies and build your best deck in this singleplayer Roguelike Trading Card Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Trading Card Game Experience:</strong>\u00a0The joy of Trading Card Games without having to spend real-world currency on booster packs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Booster packs:</strong> Open booster packs to obtain exciting new cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding:</strong> Builds decks with potent synergies or to counter your next opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Card market:</strong> Buy and sell cards but make sure it's the right decision for your card collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lustrum Items:</strong> Powerful artifacts that give you various advantages and make each playthrough unique.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flow:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play quick duels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go toe-to-toe with your opponent. Let your cards battle it out on the field. The player with the most victory points wins the duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/6e32d4869598e31f6a05b94fe03f2c7b.poster.avif?t=1744032166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/6e32d4869598e31f6a05b94fe03f2c7b.webm?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/6e32d4869598e31f6a05b94fe03f2c7b.mp4?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open booster packs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your prize money to buy booster packs and gain powerful new cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/2684b49b9bbf256f87b429894f08cb9f.poster.avif?t=1744032166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/2684b49b9bbf256f87b429894f08cb9f.webm?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/2684b49b9bbf256f87b429894f08cb9f.mp4?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Build your deck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your deck with synergies and counters before facing your next opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/79db3c5f7aa8249dc5f67444c58b10b8.poster.avif?t=1744032166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/79db3c5f7aa8249dc5f67444c58b10b8.webm?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/79db3c5f7aa8249dc5f67444c58b10b8.mp4?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the next Champion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your duel skills and grow your card collection before the next champion challenges you to a duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/ed572815e7bcdad0caedce4e7ae41370.poster.avif?t=1744032166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/ed572815e7bcdad0caedce4e7ae41370.webm?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367680/extras/ed572815e7bcdad0caedce4e7ae41370.mp4?t=1744032166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain mysterious lustrum items </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated champions reward you with lustrum items which can grant you various bonusses on and off the duel field.\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
